{"seq":2,"slug":"intellectual-honesty","title":"科学诚实","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/ideas-and-methods/intellectual-honesty","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-principle-of-not-fooling-yourself","title":"不要欺骗自己","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/ideas-and-methods/intellectual-honesty/the-principle-of-not-fooling-yourself","wordCount":1582,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"cargo-cult-science","title":"草包族科学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/ideas-and-methods/intellectual-honesty/cargo-cult-science","wordCount":1619,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"科学诚实\">科学诚实</h1><p>本章剖析费曼思想中最具道德分量的部分：对科学诚实的极致坚持。在他看来，诚实——尤其是对自己的诚实——是科学之所以可靠的根本前提。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述他著名的&quot;第一原则&quot;：不要欺骗自己，而你恰恰是最容易被自己欺骗的人。第二篇文档讲述他提出的&quot;草包族科学&quot;概念，以此尖锐批判那些徒有科学外表、却缺乏诚实内核的研究。</p>\n"}